{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚串起了满足生出延续愿望、眼前的亲近不再足以承托这个愿望、继续加力也无法补足、用力退去而牵挂仍在的因果链，尤其准确地点出了松弛不等于想通；但对幸福为何忽然像已成过去、对方心意的不确定如何在此刻浮现，以及身体为何能先于念头放松，解释得较为简略。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版具体解释了满足感退去后未安顿的部分为何浮现、沉浸中断后时间感与关系不确定性为何使幸福变得像一段过去，以及身体如何先于明确念头松开、放松又如何不必转为慌张；但它没有甲版那样直接地指出继续加大热切无法满足延续愿望，而且把期待持续未受伤解释为身体防备松动，属于较具体但仍需推断的一环。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙版虽然没有甲版那样凝练地突出加力无效这一机制，但保留了满足退去、未解牵挂浮现和松手后牵挂仍在的核心因果，并进一步说明时间感、对方心意的不确定与身体先于念头的放松如何共同造成此刻的转折，因此其增加的是有因果作用的解释，而不只是篇幅与故事细节。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4f842ad7-6708-4474-9232-e282dd07212d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135106316740Z", "elapsed_seconds": 97.141, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:52:43.458541+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "715460c38d0780ba51fd0d1e3089122933b280af21282f00f9c6a312ed130f70", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f1